<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Cokoladovny CZK 600.8 mln H1 gross.</title>
<headline>Czech Cokoladovny CZK 600.8 mln H1 gross.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six-month period ending June 30, 1996: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> pre-tax profit	 600.84     vs    482</p>
<p> Total revenue	 5,009.62    vs    4,509</p>
<p> Operational profit    639.02    vs	n/a</p>
<p>Result from</p>
<p> financial operations  -31.53    vs	n/a</p>
<p>Note: The company's full name is Cokoladovny a.s., the largest Czech confectioner. Cokoladovny Partners, a joint venture of Danone SA and Nestle SA, holds a 68 percent stake in the firm.</p>
<p>-- Alan Crosby, Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
